			"notes": "Hid speed particles on asphalt blocks\nImplemented Pallet rotation and proper sounds\nBulk redstone torch crafting to go alongside bulk torches\nAdded wall-mounted signs (as a blockstate)\nGiving a redstone signal to signs will make them light up with flashing lights (emissive textures planned)\nAdded the ability to add flags to jersey walls and highway barriers\nFixed all texture z-fighting (same as ModFest patch)\nFix broken loottables (same as ModFest patch)"
